# Reachability and Mapbox

- Page-only code stays under `pages/Reachability/{components,constants,utils,types,services,hooks}/`.
- Import `mapbox-gl` dynamically inside map hooks; keep `MapView` behind `React.lazy`.
- Calculation hooks must abort in-flight requests on unmount and rapid re-calculate.
- Contour minutes must be strictly increasing and unique (`build-contours.ts`).
- Map fit padding must account for the bottom-sheet layout via `use-map-fit-padding`.
- Pass individual stable `useRef` handles into map sub-hooks; do not bundle refs in a new object each render.
- Export/download logic belongs in `pages/Reachability/services/`, not top-level `services/`.
